  "title": "Kerala's UDF Govt Approaches Multi-Angled Probe into LDF's Failed Bid to Host Argentina Football Team in Kochi",
  "summary": "The Kerala government has ordered a multi-agency inquiry into the previous LDF government’s failed and costly bid to host the Argentine football team in Kochi 2025, with the focus on potential anti-corruption allegations, as a precursor to a likely inquiry referral.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Kerala government has ordered a multi-agency inquiry into the previous LDF government’s failed and costly bid to host the Argentine football team in Kochi 2025",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The inquiry will involve the Finance department and other relevant agencies to investigate allegations of misuse of government funds and potential loss to the exchequer",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Chief Minister V.D. Satheesan has indicated the government will continue to monitor the situation and ensure transparency in the process",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
